                <div class="col col-half">
                    <h3 class="postingHeader">Minimum Requirements</h3>

                    <span id="lblMinimumReqsInClassSpec">You will find the Minimum Requirements in the Class Specification.</span><ul><li><a href='https://hrnet.calhr.ca.gov/CalHRNet/SpecCrossReference.aspx?ClassID=1757' target='_blank'>FIRE CAPTAIN (PARAMEDIC)</a></li></ul>
                </div>
            

            <div class="col col-half" style="vertical-align: top;">
                <h3 class="postingHeader">Additional Documents</h3>

                <ul><li><a href='http://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Jobs/JobApplicationPackageChecklist.aspx?JobControlId=458572'>Job Application Package Checklist</a></li><li><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=25734151&name=SCUPO-199FCP.pdf'>Duty Statement</a></li></ul>

            </div>

